Usage: hammond_pedal_trace --profile PROFILE --scenario unmute|overlap|routing
       --sample-rate 44100|48000|96000 --seed UINT64 --output TRACE.csv
All five options are required exactly once. --help must be used alone.
Fixed 120 ms nominal pedal trace; at most 11520 rows and 8 MiB.
Ideal manuals and eight ideal pedal contacts; percussion off; fixed scenario controls.
Rows: actual rendered pedal record and audio; phase before that sample; clock after it.
Output parent must exist; existing paths are never overwritten; hard links required.
Synthetic engineering diagnostics, not measured hardware or a DSP checkpoint.

